REVYTECH, Inc. packaging of wf-config — the configuration library used by
the Wayfire compositor and shell.

This is the revytechinc fork (origin: github.com/revytechinc/wf-config)
with FreeBSD compatibility work. It conflicts with the stock FreeBSD
ports wf-config package; install only one stack.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/wf-config
